<refnamediv>
<refname>yafftotext.pl</refname>
<refpurpose>filter to convert YAFF fonts to Unscii text fonts</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<cmdsynopsis>
<command>yafftotext.pl</command>
</cmdsynopsis>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection><title>Description</title>

<para>
<command>yafftotext.pl</command> reads a font in Yet Another Font Format (YAFF) format from its standard input and prints the font in Unscii text format to its standard output.
</para>

<para>
Comments are passed through with the <quote>#</quote> character turned into a TAB character.
All other YAFF metadata are lost, as the Unscii text format does not have metadata.
</para>

</refsection>

<refsection><title>Author</title>
